# CODEOWNERS — draft for backbencher-hq/backbencher-brain
#
# GitHub reads the last matching pattern, so the specific rules below override the
# catch-all. This is a DRAFT: replace @ishaq2321 with org teams once they exist, e.g.
#   *                          @backbencher-hq/maintainers
#   /src/ast/                  @backbencher-hq/analyzers
#   /website/                  @backbencher-hq/site
# Teams are only usable after they are created in the org and given write access to
# this repository; a CODEOWNERS line naming a missing team is silently ignored, so
# land this file only when the handle in it resolves.
#
# Rationale for the split: the engine and its analyzers are where correctness claims
# live, the generated data is what the site renders as fact, and the gates are the
# review — so each area has an explicit owner rather than relying on the catch-all.

# Catch-all: every path not listed below.
